# PATTERN 4: MONITOR
# Demo timings: check every 10 seconds and give up after 2 minutes (production: 15 min / 24 h).
# Try it twice: once uploading the file (step 2), once letting it time out (skip step 2).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7268/api
@hostUrl = http://localhost:7268

### 1. Start watching for acme's file
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitor/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerId": "acme",
  "fileName": "orders-2026-11-03.csv",
  "pollIntervalSeconds": 10,
  "timeoutMinutes": 2
}

### 2. Simulate acme uploading the file. The next check finds it and the monitor completes with output true.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/monitor/partners/acme/files/orders-2026-11-03.csv

### 3. Status: customStatus shows the number of checks and the deadline
GET {{hostUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/monitor-acme

### 4. Stop watching early (terminate)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/monitor/partners/acme
